      "content": "Before I choose a workflow, please tell me:\n- Are the mutation calls somatic calls from tumor-normal pairs?\n  You wrote: \"I'm not sure whether the mutation calls are somatic calls from tumor-normal pairs or germline variants from blood\". SAMBAR's contract: \"SAMBAR consumes a samples-by-genes somatic mutation CSV\".\n\nNo workflow has been selected and nothing runs before you answer.\n\nNo files were inspected and no analysis ran."
